  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0574126e70a10656",
      "translationZh": "我一直在为 Radeon Instinct MI50 GPU 的散热问题苦恼。我正在寻找价格实惠的解决方案。运行多个 GPU 时，它通常不会太热。我使用标准 Vulkan 的 'llama 7B Q4_0' 模型基准测试时，得到的分数也偏低，但这并不是热降频造成的。该优化一下了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ce8de1452b51a09",
      "translationZh": "刷有 Radeon VII 固件的 MI50，16GB 显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75f69657473fde96",
      "translationZh": "在上一篇帖子中，我用同一组 GPU 测试了几个模型。这次我做了一些调整。我把 MI50 16gb 移到了主 PCIe 16x 插槽，并把 RX 7900 GRE 16gb 移到了较慢的 PCIe 4x 插槽。系统的整体推理性能提升了。我借助 Google Gemini 优化了 llama-bench 设置，它还教会了我以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "309a93e960a448e4",
      "translationZh": "RADV_PERFTEST=nogttspill 是一个 AMD Linux 驱动标志，用于通过 Vulkan 后端运行 llama.cpp 的场景。它会强制 RADV（Mesa Vulkan）驱动优先将模型的所有内存分配保留在专用显存（VRAM）中，而不是溢出到系统内存（GTT/图形转换表）中。[ 1 , 2 , 3 ]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "845f42fa4656f3c2",
      "translationZh": "我看到 llama 7B Q4_0 的分数回升到了应有的水平。所以我又测试了几个其他模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a184b99784d26c8",
      "translationZh": "之前的基准测试：https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLM/s/PT6Bd5nUUE 对比请见末尾",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd620695f1c357ab",
      "translationZh": "列表已按 pp512 的改善幅度降序排列（从最大提升到最大下降）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f8d66f87a4e88a2",
      "translationZh": "模型名称 改善幅度（pp512） 改善幅度（tg128）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d6aca445eba79c2",
      "translationZh": "这些是参与测试的模型，顺序与下方表格相同：GGUF 模型列表（按顺序）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92c29f1c294cfd41",
      "translationZh": "支撑数据的排序顺序（先按 Params 降序，再按 Size 降序）。所有模型均使用双 Radeon GPU、Vulkan 后端，并开启闪存注意力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "09d4b886593205f4",
      "translationZh": "表 1：正在使用 RADV_PERFTEST=nogttspill",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1714a37555d7383b",
      "translationZh": "模型 大小 参数量 pp512 tg128",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2b8c4f535ffc6e7",
      "translationZh": "qwen35moe 35B.A3B Q5_K - 中等",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15182870b06f616d",
      "translationZh": "qwen35moe 35B.A3B Q5_K - 小型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5aa3514a60f6b2f4",
      "translationZh": "laguna 30B.A3B Q5_K - 中型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "272c1077ad5f1049",
      "translationZh": "nemotron_h_moe 31B.A3.5B Q5_K - 中型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "417ba057bfe5c1f6",
      "translationZh": "gemma4 26B.A4B Q4_K - 中型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "37e3ac7c8336f80e",
      "translationZh": "表 2：未使用 RADV_PERFTEST=nogttspill",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dc7eabbafec382d",
      "translationZh": "调换 Radeon Instinct MI50 和 Radeon RX 7900 GRE 的 PCIe 插槽位置，并使用 RADV_PERFTEST=nogttspill 标志后，相比我最初的基准测试结果，性能有所提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37a21c4330cc1fde",
      "translationZh": "注意：仅列出两个数据集中都出现的模型。表格按参数量降序排列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "526845f648413093",
      "translationZh": "看起来 MoE 模型受益最大。Muse-glimmer 30B Q6_K 实际上没有明显提升，但它似乎是优化得最好的稠密模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "363ee2b954a933df",
      "translationZh": "MI50 的表现依然令人印象深刻。我以每块 150 的价格买了这些二手卡。现在我可以使用 Q6 量化运行 30B 到 35B 的模型，处理较长的内容，速度也不错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26c21ca02cee1e5d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/tabletuser_blogspot 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
